    "detailed_description": "<i>A Planet of Mine</i> is a mini procedural 4X. Starting from a single and unique planet, survive, gather and combine resources, develop your technologies and start the conquest of space.<br><br>Choose your strategy wisely to colonize the procedurally generated system and dominate opposing factions by force or exchanges.<br><br>This PC edition include all updates from the original awarded mobile version.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real time simulation of resources (APOM Engine)<br></li><li>Procedural generation of stellar systems, planets, biomes and resources<br></li><li>3 game modes (infinite, time attack, builder)<br></li><li>Personalized games<br></li><li>10 scenarios to complete<br></li><li>16 animal factions to unlock and play</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170980/extras/36f0d9f12dab4e6aac3c35b35f45e30e.avif?t=1698175220\" /></div>",
